# Supply-chain agent

- Pin Node / pnpm via `.nvmrc`, `engines`, and Corepack `packageManager` sha512 (`TOOLCHAIN.pins`).
- Hardening lives in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (pnpm v11+): `preferFrozenLockfile`, `allowBuilds`, `trustPolicy: no-downgrade`, `trustLockfile`, audit `overrides`.
- `.npmrc` is registry/auth only on pnpm v11+.
- Lifecycle scripts only via `allowBuilds` whitelist. Do not widen without user approval.
- After override or pin changes: refresh lockfile deliberately, restore `trustPolicy: no-downgrade`, then `pnpm check:toolchain` + `pnpm check:pnpm`.
- CI must keep `pnpm audit --prod --audit-level=high` failing the job (no silent `continue-on-error`).
